      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86611938476562,
        392.47467041015625,
        527.3871459960938,
        406.9176940917969
      ],
      "text": "Both recommendations may apply to people with or without HIV. The GDG noted the significantly",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86611938476562,
        405.6746826171875,
        527.3909912109375,
        420.1177062988281
      ],
      "text": "higher risk of infants and young children < 5 years for developing TB. Furthermore, the disease can",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86611938476562,
        418.87469482421875,
        527.4091796875,
        433.3177185058594
      ],
      "text": "develop rapidly in young children, and they are at greatest risk of severe and disseminated disease,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        432.07470703125,
        527.5386352539062,
        446.5177307128906
      ],
      "text": "which are associated with high morbidity and mortality. Therefore, the GDG strongly recommended TPT",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        445.27471923828125,
        527.391357421875,
        459.7177429199219
      ],
      "text": "for child household contacts aged < 5 years, regardless of HIV status and background epidemiology",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        458.4747009277344,
        304.8927917480469,
        472.9177551269531
      ],
      "text": "out. of TB, but only after TB disease has been ruled",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86614990234375,
        480.1785888671875,
        527.4102172851562,
        494.6216125488281
      ],
      "text": "TPT is also conditionally recommended for household contacts in other age groups, according to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86614990234375,
        493.3786926269531,
        527.4321899414062,
        507.82171630859375
      ],
      "text": "clinical judgement on the balance between harm and benefit for individuals and the national and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86614990234375,
        506.57861328125,
        527.4146728515625,
        521.0216064453125
      ],
      "text": "local epidemiology of TB, with special consideration of ongoing transmission of TB. In this group,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        519.7786865234375,
        403.8001403808594,
        534.2216796875
      ],
      "text": "confirmation of TBI with either IGRA or a skin test would be desirable (see",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.997149467468262,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        403.2164001464844,
        519.7786865234375,
        451.7860107421875,
        534.2216796875
      ],
      "text": "section 1.3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.997149467468262,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        451.76300048828125,
        519.7786865234375,
        527.4522705078125,
        534.2216796875
      ],
      "text": "). With evidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.997149467468262,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        532.9786376953125,
        527.4266357421875,
        547.421630859375
      ],
      "text": "of moderate to high certainty, the 2015 guidelines strongly recommended systematic testing and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        546.1785888671875,
        527.608154296875,
        560.62158203125
      ],
      "text": "treatment of TBI in contacts, regardless of age, in countries with a TB incidence < 100/100 000",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        558.1026611328125,
        527.1845703125,
        573.8216552734375
      ],
      "text": "(37) population . In the 2020 update, the GDG considered that this recommendation could be applied",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.989495277404785,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        572.5787353515625,
        527.5439453125,
        587.021728515625
      ],
      "text": "in any country regardless of TB burden if tests for TBI and tests to rule out TB are available and reliable.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.96479320526123,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        585.7786254882812,
        527.4357299804688,
        600.2216186523438
      ],
      "text": "Treatment may be justifiable without a TBI test after an assessment of the individual’s risk of exposure",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        598.9786376953125,
        527.4371337890625,
        613.421630859375
      ],
      "text": "and for development of TB disease in a given setting. The GDG noted that important considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        612.1785888671875,
        527.149169921875,
        626.62158203125
      ],
      "text": "in implementation of these recommendations are the capacity of a caregiver to assess the intensity of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.988594055175781,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        625.3787231445312,
        527.4453735351562,
        639.8217163085938
      ],
      "text": "exposure, the risks of infection and reinfection, the risk for developing TB disease and ascertainment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        638.5787353515625,
        527.3818359375,
        653.021728515625
      ],
      "text": "of TBI by testing, as well as capacity to weigh the harm versus the benefit of treatment and the ability",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        651.778564453125,
